       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adopt ducks and ducklings to keep your bunnies company!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Decorate your park with new items such as a windmill, tulips and a pond!",
